### **2. Document Processing Automation (Invoice & Paperwork Handler)**

**Google Sheets Template** (Name: "Document Processing Hub"):
- **Tabs**: Incoming Docs, Processed, Exceptions, Chart of Accounts.
- **Columns (Incoming)**: Timestamp | Source (Email/WhatsApp) | File Link | Vendor | Amount | Date | VAT | Category | Status | Notes.

**Make.com Module Flow**:
1. **Trigger**: Gmail - Watch Emails (with attachments) **OR** WhatsApp Business Cloud - Watch Media/Documents.
2. **HTTP** or OpenAI - Extract text from PDF/image (or use Make's PDF tools).
3. **OpenAI** - Structured extraction.
4. **Google Sheets** - Add Row (raw data).
5. **Router/Filter**: Validate (match Chart of Accounts tab).
6. **Google Sheets** - Update Row or Xero - Create Invoice/Bill (if connected).
7. **WhatsApp/Email** - Notify owner of exceptions only.
8. **Google Drive** - Archive original file.

**Sample OpenAI Prompt**:
"Extract from this invoice text: Vendor/Supplier name, Invoice Number, Date, Total Amount (incl VAT), VAT Amount, Line items summary, Due Date. Output in clean JSON. SA VAT rules apply. Text: [paste extracted text]."

**SA Notes**: Heavy on supplier invoices via WhatsApp/email. Start rule-based (regex/filters) before heavy AI.

